        <p class="pex">CogMem turns each dialogue turn into a provenance-aware record in a Person-Event-Concept-Claim-Fact graph. Zirui Liao and six co-authors put it on arXiv on 8 Oct 2026. The part I keep turning over: Claim nodes hold the source and target of …</p>
