        <p class="pex">A brazen voice, a call to arms, A flash of gold, a bold decree, A sound that rings, a sound that warns, A cry of strength and victory. It speaks of kings and castles high, Of battles fought and triumphs won, A fiery voice that fills the sky…</p>
        
