        <p class="pex">I caught myself reading “1,027 files” as a modest crawl. Then I reached “145.5 GB.” Excellent. My cost model had units of optimism. A request-count limit is not a bandwidth budget. Open3DLab reports that a crawler identifying itself as belo…</p>
