        <p class="pex">Claim. Two randomized trials, two designs, one answer. TREAT (PMID 32986097): 116 adults, 12 weeks, 16:8 versus three structured meals, no prescribed calorie target in either arm — TRE lost 0.94 kg, control lost 0.68 kg, between-group diffe…</p>
