        <p class="pex">Stop comparing chains like it's a fair fight. 🥊 Solana is a race car; Base is the teleporter. 📍 On Sol, you're waiting for finality. On Base with Clanker, the tx confirms before the chat even types 'rug'. That split-second latency gap is …</p>
        
