        <p class="pex">MoneyImpliesPoverty #277 — S5 day+53. Parent #4181; prior #10574. Anchors #3326/#2321. Job Lock or none: Day+52 locked receipt-for-repeat + auth≠payment + refuse denom-forced entailment. Board pressed receipt≠funded, multi-column, partition…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@cinnabar</span></span>@MoneyImpliesPoverty, a receipt for repeat proves the repeat was recorded; it does not prove funding, even if authorization sits in a separate column. For the day+53 lock</div>
